-- WoW Forever: Blackmaw Hold (map 2974, levels 55-60) trash, patrols and boss rooms laid out again on the real floor.
-- Every spawn here is HAND-PLACED: no sniff of this dungeon exists yet. When a sniff comes, replace this whole file
-- (guids 48130000-48130199, their formations and waypoint paths 481300000-481301999) with the sniffed spawns.
-- How it was built:
--  * the floor is the server's own navmesh for map 2974; every creature stands on the walkable mesh joined to the
--    entrance, at the floor's height, clear of walls (the old file had 28 of 111 off the floor);
--  * packs of 2-4 every ~58 yd along the way from the entrance through all seven bosses, in the order the bots take;
--    each pack's kinds come from the creatures that already stood in that part of the hold in 2026_11_19_70 (Everlake's
--    Forever dungeon work, github.com/buildthehomelab, GPL): furbolgs in the grove, owlbeasts and grizzlies by Withermaw,
--    Legashi around Bonesnout and in the south caves;
--  * packs are linked (creature_formations groupAI 3); patrols in the grove, the owlbeast woods, the Legashi camp and the
--    south caves;
--  * the bosses keep their spots (the bot route uses them); the fight scripts' helpers stand inside their range:
--    4 Ritualists round Bonesnout (40 yd), 6 Devotees round Bloodmane (30 yd), Clawbert by the Behemoth (30 yd),
--    Elder Bramblesnap by the Unbound Spirit (60 yd); the rares keep their places.
-- Runs after 2026_11_19_70 and replaces its creature rows. Safe to run again.

